<figure class="fig"><div class="fig-body"><div class="widget" data-widget="topp" data-args="{}"></div></div><figcaption>The phase plane of path position s and path speed. The red curve is the maximum velocity curve; the green profile is the time-optimal schedule, which touches it or rides an acceleration limit everywhere. Change the limits and watch the profile and the travel time respond.</figcaption></figure>
